        "TileImage": "$($repository 4e98437d-49e2-4cbd-a081-6c3f34c7797d).Image",
        "Description": "Our client today (presumably one of our targets) has requested we take out four of his fellow guards and himself as he regrets a certain &quot;incident&quot; he and the other 4 had staged. He wants nobody to spot you, and nobody to find the bodies. He has stated he will still act as he would if you were not hired by him, and he wants this to be done quickly. Tread carefully, 47.",
